sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant DC as deep-chat
    participant JS as chat-bridge.js
    participant CPP as AiBridge (C++)
    participant API as LLM API

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over User,API: USER SENDS A MESSAGE
        User->>DC: Types "Run a t-test", clicks send
        DC->>JS: connect.handler(messages, signals)
        JS->>JS: currentSignals = signals
        JS->>CPP: aiBridge.startStream(json)

        Note over CPP: startStream()
        CPP->>CPP: isBusy()? reject with error if yes
        CPP->>CPP: is m_isIntroStream? kill intro silently
        CPP->>CPP: else if m_streaming? stopStream()
        CPP->>CPP: append new msgs to m_conversation
        CPP->>CPP: clear delta, toolCallAccum, toolCallOrder
        CPP->>CPP: check token limit (reject if exceeded)
        CPP-->>JS: emit onStreamOpen()
        JS->>DC: signals.onOpen()
        Note over DC: new AI message bubble appears
        CPP->>API: POST /chat/completions (SSE, with tools)
        Note over CPP,API: body: model, stream, messages, tools, extraParams
        loop SSE streaming
            API-->>CPP: delta: content "Sure"
            CPP->>CPP: merge into m_assistantDelta
            CPP-->>JS: onStreamChunk("Sure")
            JS->>DC: signals.onResponse
            API-->>CPP: delta: content ", running now"
            CPP-->>JS: onStreamChunk(", running now")
            JS->>DC: signals.onResponse
        end
        API-->>CPP: stream done
        Note over CPP: onReplyFinished()
        CPP->>CPP: process remaining SSE buffer
        Note over CPP: no tool calls: save asst msg to m_conversation
        Note over CPP: m_processingReply=false, m_streaming=false
        CPP-->>JS: emit onStreamClose()
        JS->>DC: signals.onClose()
        Note over CPP: if deferredClearChat: execute now
    end
